# The Spyro 3 Area warp pair table (tests/harness/check_s3_areawarp.sh).
#
# One row per (start area, target sub-area) pair of the 17 multi-area
# levels: every area-0 -> sub-area pair (38) and every sub-area -> other
# sub-area pair (50). from 0 boots with --skip-to-level, any other from with
# --skip-to-area <level>:<from>; the warp then targets <level>:<to>
# through OPENPETE_AREAWARP_TEST.
#
# set: default rows run without --all (each level's 0 -> 1 and 1 -> 2, plus
# dino_mines 3 -> 1, whose area-0 arrival opens a speech on the arrival
# tick); full rows run only with --all.
#
# Fields, pipe-separated: name | level | from | to | set
sunny_villa_0_1 | sunny_villa | 0 | 1 | default
sunny_villa_0_2 | sunny_villa | 0 | 2 | full
sunny_villa_1_2 | sunny_villa | 1 | 2 | default
sunny_villa_2_1 | sunny_villa | 2 | 1 | full
